<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">Ruth</book>
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Biaceihtu hna nih an rak uk lioah khan ram chungah cun mangṭam a tlung i, Judah ram chung i Bethlehem khuami pakhat cu, a nupi le a fapa pahnih hna he tiah, Moab ram i pem awkah an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cu mipa a min cu Elimelek a si, a nupi min cu Naomi a si i a fapa pahnih hna min cu Mahlon le Khilion an si; Judah ram chung Bethlehem khua i Efrath mi an si. Moab ram ah cun an va kal i khika ah an va um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Naomi va Elimelek cu a thi i amah le a fapa pahnih cu a roh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Moab minu kha nupi ah an ṭhit hna; pakhat cu a min ah Orpah a si i a dang pakhat cu a min ah Ruth a si. Khika ah kum hra tluk an um i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahlon le Khilion cu an pahnih in an thi i, cucaah Naomi cu a fapa pahnih hna le a va nih khan an roh ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun a fapale nupi hna he khan tiah kir ṭhan awkah Moab ram khan aa thawh, zeitintiah Bawipa nih a mi kha a len cang hna i rawl a pek hna ti kha, Moab ram chung khan a theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cucaah a umnak hmun khan a fapale nupi hna he khan aa thawh i Judah ram i kir ṭhannak lam ah khan an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Naomi nih a fapale nupi pahnih hna kha a thawh hna i, “Va kal cang u, nanmah le nan nu le inn cio ah khan va kir cang u. Mithi hna le keimah cungah nan tuah bantuk hin Bawipa nih nan cungah zaangfahnak tuah ve ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun nan pahnih in va inn tangah khuasaknak nan ton khawh nakhnga Bawipa nih zaangfahnak in pe ko hna seh!” tiah a ti. Cun a hnamh hna i nguingui thlak in an ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun annih nih amah cu, “Kan kir lai lo, nangmah sinah na miphun hna sinah kan kir ve ko lai,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Naomi nih, “Ka fanule hna, kir ko u, zeicahdah keimah sinah cun nan kal lai? Nan va ding caah ka paw chungah fapa ka ngeih ti ṭung hna lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Va kir ko u, ka fanule hna, va kal ko u, va ngeih awkah ka tar tuk cang. Ruahchannak ka ngei rih tiin tuzan hmanh ah hin va hei ngei in fapa hei ngei hna ning law,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />nannih nih an upat tiang nan hngah hna hnga maw? Va ngei loin maw nan um ko hnga? Si hlah e, ka fanu hna, nanmah caah hin ka ngaih a chia hringhran ko, Bawipa kut cu keimah doh ah cun pei a chuah cang fam cu,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun nguingui thlak in an ṭap ṭhan; Orpah nih cun a pi cu a hnamh, sihmanhsehlaw Ruth tu nih cun aa tlaih peng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun amah nih, “Zohhmanh, na va unau nupi cu amah miphun le a pathian hna sinah a kir cang; nang zong na va unau nupi cu zul in kir ve tuah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Ruth nih, “Nangmah he i ṭhen awk le nangmah zul lo i kir ṭhan awkah ka lem len hlah; zeicahtiah na kalnak ah ka kal ve lai i na riahnak ah ka riak ve lai; na miphun cu ka miphun an si ve lai i na Pathian cu ka Pathian a si ve lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na thihnak ah ka thi ve lai i khika ah cun an ka vui ve ko lai. Pathian nih cu bantukin ka cungah tuah seh law, tam deuh zongin tuah ko seh, thihnak hmanh nih nangmah sinin ka ṭhen ai kun,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Naomi nih amah sinah kal aa tim hrimhrim ti kha a hmuh tikah zeihmanh a chim ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cucaah Bethlehem tiangin an pahnih in an kal. Cun Bethlehem an phak tikah anmah ruangah an khuapi in an i tuai ur i nu hna nih cun, “Mah hihi Naomi kha a si maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun anih nih annih cu, “Naomi ka ti hlah u, Mara ka ti u, zeicahtiah Lianngan Bik nih khaa ngaingai in ka cungah a tuah cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khatte in ka rak kal i Bawipa nih kutro in a ka kirpi ṭhan. Bawipa nih a ka hrem i Lianngan Bik nih ka cungah harnak a tlunter tikah hin zeicahdah Naomi nan ka ti?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cu bantukin Naomi cu, Moab ram in a kirmi Moab minu Ruth, a fapa nupi he khan a ra kir. Cun annih cu barli ṭuan domh ah khin Bethlehem khua an phan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Naomi nih cun a va rualchan, Elimelek chung, mirum ngai, rualchan pakhat a ngei i a min cu Boaz a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Moab minu Ruth nih cun Naomi cu a thawh i, “Lo ah va kal ning law a rak ka zaangfahtu paoh sinah famua ka va sua lai,” tiah a ti. Cun anih nih, “Va kal ko, ka fanu,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah aa thawh i a kal i rawlṭuantu hna hnuah khan famua cu a va sua; cun Elimelek chung a simi Boaz ta a simi lo ah cun a va phan sual ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun zohhmanh, Boaz cu Bethlehem in a ra i rawlṭuantu hna sinah cun, “ Bawipa cu nan sinah um ko seh,” tiah a ti. Cun annih nih, “ Bawipa nih thluachuah in pe ko seh,” tiah an leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Boaz nih rawlṭuantu a zohtu hna a sinum sinah cun, “Mah hihi mizei ngaknu dah a si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun rawlṭuantu a zohtu hna sinum nih cun, “Moab mi ngaknu kha a si, Moab ram in Naomi he a raminu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah nih hin, ‘Zaangfahnak tein, rawlṭuantu hna hnuah hin faphal lakah famua ka suatter law, ka pumhter ko,’ tiah a ti. Cucaah a ra i zingka tein atu tiang a ṭuan lengmang, tlawmte hmanh i din hin loin,” tiah a leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Boaz nih Ruth sinah cun, “Ngaihmanh, ka fanu, lo dang i famua va suat awkah kal hlah; hi zong hi chuahtak hlah, sihmanhsehlaw ka ngaknu pawl sinah hin um peng ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Annih nih an ṭuan liomi lo kha i zoh law, annih hnu in zul hna. Tlangval hna cu nangmah kha in tonghtham lo awkah bia ka riah hna khah. Cun na ti a hal tikah ti um ah khan va kal law, tlangval nih an thanmi kha va ding ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun a kun i vawlei lei hoih in a lu a khun in amah cu, “Phun dang mi ka si cu na hngalh ko, asinain, keimah cu na hei ka hngalh duh nakhnga ah, zeicahdah na hmaiah mithmai ṭha cu ka hmuh e?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Boaz nih a leh i, “Na va a thih ri in na pi cung i na tuahmi vialte cu tling tein an ka chimh dih ko, na nu le na pa le na chuahnak ram na kaltak hna i a hlan i na hngalh bal lomi miphun sin i na ratnak hawi hna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa nih na tuah ciami cu in rul seh law, Bawipa, Israel Pathian, a thla tangah i dor awk i na rak fuhmi nih cun, tampi in laksawng in pe ko seh!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun anih nih, “Ka bawipa, ka cungah na ṭha hringhran ko, zeitintiah ka hna na ka ngamter i, na salnu si ve hmanh hlah ning law, na salnu sinah hin bia nemnem na chim,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun rawl ei caan ah Boaz nih amah cu, “Hika hin ra law, changreu hawi hna hi ra ei ve, na changreu cheuchum cu mitsur hang chungah hnim ve,” tiah a ti. Cucaah rawl ṭuantu hna pawngah khan a ṭhu i vaireu kha Boaz nih a hei chanh i a khim tiang a ei, ei bang zong tlawmpal a ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Famua suat awkah aa thawh tikah khan, Boaz nih a tlangval pawl cu, “Faphal lakah hin suatter ko u law, si hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun a tom chung hna zong khan zuhpiak u law, kaltak hna u law, hun i suat seh, caa hlah u,” tiin nawl a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cucaah lo chungah cun zanlei tiang a sua; a suatmi cu a tuk i barli ephah pakhat hrawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun aa phorh i khua chungah a lut; a pi cu a suatmi kha a hmuhsak, cun a khim hnu i a tangmi rawl zong kha a chuah i a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun a pi nih khan amah cu, “Khuazei ah dah nihin cu na suat? Cun khuazei ah dah na ṭuan? Nangmah a rak in hngal duhtu cu thluachuahnak hmu ko seh,” tiah a ti. Cucaah a pi cu aho sin i a ṭuan kha a chimh i, “Nihin ah a sin i ka ṭuan mipa min cu Boaz a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Naomi nih a fapa nupi sinah cun, “A nungmi cungah siseh, a thimi cungah siseh, a zaangfahnak a ngol lomi Bawipa nih cun amah cu thluachuahnak pe ko seh!” tiah a ti. Cun Naomi nih a sinah, “Cu pa cu kan rualchan a si, kan sahlawh naih bik a si,” tiah a ti fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Moab minu Ruth nih cun, “Cu hleiah, ‘Ka rawl ṭuan an dih hlantiang ka sinum hna sinah hin na um ve ko lai,’ a ka ti pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Naomi nih, a fapa nupi Ruth sinah cun, “Ka fanu, a sinum ngaknu hna sin i na kal cu a ṭha ko lai, lo dang ah cun an in tonghtham sual hnga,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cucaah Boaz ngaknu pawl sinah cun, barli le changvut ṭuan a dih tiang a um i famua cu a sua lengmang; cun a pi sinah cun a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun a pi Naomi nih cun amah cu a thawh i, “Ka fanu, nangmah ca i a ṭhat nakhnga, khuasaknak kawlpiak loin maw kan um hnga?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ngaknu pawl he na va umnak Boaz kha kan rualchan a si lo maw? Zohhmanh, tuzan ah phuhri ah barli a zap lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah i kholh law, sathau i thuh law, na hnipuan ṭha bik i hruk hna law, phuhri ah cun vung kal tuah; sihmanhsehlaw ei le din a dih hlantiang, mipa sinah cun i hngalhter hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw a ih tikah a ihnak kha i ngiat; cun va kal law, a ke kha va hlim law, va it ve; cun amah nih zei tuah awk kha an chimh lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun anih nih, “Na chimmi paoh cu ka tuah lai,” tiah a leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cucaah phuhri ah cun a vung kal i a pi nih a chimh bantukte khan a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Boaz cu a ei a din dih in a lung aa lawm i rawltlun hram i ih awkah a kal. Cun din tein a ra i a ke cu a hlim i a it ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun zanlai ah mipa cu a lau i a khel aa let i, zohhmanh, nu pakhat kha a kehram ah a rak it ko!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun, “Ahodah na si?” tiah a ti i, “Na salnu Ruth ka si; ka rualchan naih na si caah na salnu hi na puan ka zawn tuah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun anih nih, “Ka fanu, Bawipa nih thluachuahnak in pe ko seh; tlangval a sifakmi siseh, a rummi siseh na zulh hna lonak ah hin, a hmasa bik i nak hmanh khan hi a hmanung bik na vel hi na dawhter deuh cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun ka fanu, ṭih hlah, ka khuapi hawi vialte nih nangmah cu mi ṭha na si kha an hngalh ko caah na ka halmi vialte cu kan tuahpiak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun keimah cu na rualchan naih ka si taktak, asinain keimah nakin a nai deuhmi pakhat a um rih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuzan cu hika ah um ko, thaizing ah amah nih nangmah caah aa naihmi rualchan nih tuah awk kha a tuah duh ahcun, a ṭha ko; tuah ko seh. Sihmanhsehlaw nangmah caah aa naihmi rualchan nih tuah awk kha a tuah duh lo ahcun, khi tikah, keimah nih, Bawipa a nun bangin, nangmah ca i aa naihmi rualchan nih tuah awk cu ka tuah lai. Zinglei tiangin it ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah a kehram ah cun zinglei tiang a it, sihmanhsehlaw ahohmanh fiangfai in i hmuh khawh hlanah khin a tho; cun amah nih, “Phuhri ah minu a ra ti kha ahohmanh theihter lo si seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun a thawh i, “Naa aihmi na puan kha rak pu law, rak dawn tuah,” tiah a ti. Cucaah a dawnh i barli kha rel ruk a tah i a cungah a khinh; cun khua chungah a lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun a pi sin a va phak tikah, “Zeitindah na si, ka fanu?” tiah a rak ti. Cun mipa nih a ca i a tuahmi vialte kha a chimh i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hi barli rel ruk hi a ka pek i, ‘Na pi sinah kut ro in na kir hrimhrim hnga lo,’ a ka ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun amah nih, “Zeitindah thil cu a si ti kha na hngalh hlantiang, ka fanu, hngak ko rih, zeicahtiah nihin ah cu thil cu a lim hlantiang mipa cu a um sawhsawh lai lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Boaz cu hauka ah khan a hung kal i khika ah a ṭhu; cun zohhmanh, Boaz i a chimmi rualchan naih kha a ra. Cucaah Boaz nih, “Ka kawi, ra pial ta rih tuah; hika ah hin ṭhu tuah,” tiah a ti i a ra pial i a ṭhu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun khua chung upa pahra kha a lak hna i, “Hika ah hin ṭhu tuah u,” a ti hna i an ṭhu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun rualchan naih sinah cun, “Moab ram in a kir ṭhanmi Naomi nih kan phunhawi Elemelek ta a simi lobung pakhat kha a zuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cucaah cun, cu kong cu nangmah kha kan chimh awk le hika i a ummi hna le ka mi hna lak i upa hna hmaiah hin caw, kan ti awk a si tiah ka ruah. Na tlanh hnga a si ahcun, tlan tuah; sihmanhsehlaw na tlanh duh lo ahcun, ka hngalh nakhnga ka chim tuah, zeicahtiah nangmah hleiah a tlantu ding an um ti lo i nangmah an changtu cu keimah ka si ko,” tiah a ti. Cun, “Ka tlanh lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Boaz nih a thawh i, “Naomi kut in lo cu na cawk ni in mithipa nupi Moab minu Ruth zong kha na cawk a si; mithipa min cu a ro ah na kirter ṭhan nakhnga,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun rualchan naihpa nih cun, “Keimah ro tu kha ka hrawh sual lai caah, keimah caah cun ka tlan kho lai lo. Keimah nih ka tlanh khawh lo caah nangmah tu nih tlan khotu ka sinak cu i lak ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun mah hihi, hlan lioah cun Israel mi lakah tlanhnak le thlennak kongah, phung a rak si; biatlaknak fehternak ah pakhat nih a kedan kha aa phoih i pakhat kha a pek, mah hihi Israel mi nih thil an rak fehterning cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cucaah rualchan naih nih khan Boaz cu, “Nangmah caah i cawk ko,” a ti tikah khan a kedan aa phoih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Boaz nih upa hna le mizapi hna sinah khan, “Nannih cu nihin ni ah hin Naomi kut chungin Elimelek ta a simi vialte le Khilion le Mahlon ta a simi vialte cu ka cawk cang hna, ti hngaltu nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mithipa min cu a unau hna sin le a chuahnak hmun hauka in a loh nakhnga lo, mithipa min cu a ro chung i hmunhter awkah, Mahlon nih a rohmi Moab minu Ruth zong kha ka nupi si awkah ka cawk cang; cucu nannih hi nihin ah hin a hngaltu nan si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun hauka ah a ummi vialte le upa hna nih khan, “Hngaltu kan si. Na inn chungah a ra ding minu cu, Rachel le Leah, Israel innchungkhar a dirhtu pahnih hna bantuk ah khan Bawipa nih ser ko seh. Efrathah ah hin khua awng tong law, Bethlehem ah na min thang ko seh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />cun Bawipa nih hi ngaknu sinin an pek laimi tefa hna thawngin, na innchungkhar cu Tamar nih Judah a hrinpiakmi Perez innchungkhar bantuk kha si ko seh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cucaah Boaz nih Ruth cu a lak i a nupi ah a cang; a theihhngalh i Bawipa nih fapawinak a pek i fapa a hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun nu hna nih khan Naomi sinah cun, “Nihin ni i rualchan naih chambau loin an umtertu Bawipa cu thangṭhat si ko seh; amah min cu Israel mi lakah thang ko seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah cu nangmah caah nunter ṭhantu le na tar leiah an cawmtu a si lai; zeitintiah na fapa nupi, nangmah an dawtu, nangmah ca i fapa pasarih nakin a ṭha deuhmi nih cun, a hrin cang,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Naomi nih ngakchia cu a lak i a pom i a umh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun innpa nu pawl nih khan min an sak i, “Naomi caah fapa a chuak,” tiah an ti. Obed tiah min an sak; amah cu David pa Jesse i a pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun mah hna hi Perez tefa cu an si: Perez cu Hezron pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hezron cu Ram pa a si, Ram cu Amminadab pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amminadab cu Nahshon pa a si, Nahshon cu Salmon pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Salmon cu Boaz pa a si, Boaz cu Obed pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Obed cu Jesse pa a si i Jesse cu David pa a si.
  </para>
</usx>
